From: Steve Veerman <757767+veerman@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 13:11:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add Leap STR100-2 loader mapping and Linux flashing notes

Map hardware ID 06002e0a (BlackBerry Leap STR100-2) to LDR_29, the
loader already used for 07002e0a. Without it, info/flash stop with
"No valid loader found for 06002E0A". loaders.ini probe results
already recorded LDR_29 working on 06002E0A.

Add docs/LINUX.md covering the libfuse2 dependency, udev access,
starting bb10mt before power-on, and flashing stock and AutoRoot
images, verified on a Leap from Linux.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
